DESCRIPTION:BI SIG Reporting Services Focus Group Presents:\nCustom Securit
	y with Reporting Services \nSpeaker: Cherie Sheriff\nMay 14th 1:00pm ET \n
	 \nIn this session we will discuss different custom security approaches wi
	th SSRS and what considerations need to be made when deciding upon a strat
	egy for security as well as the risks and benefits of each approach.\n\n\n
	Notes  \nBlythe Morrow has invited you to attend an online meeting using L
	ive Meeting. Join the meeting. <https://owa.sqlpass.org/owa/redir.aspx?URL
	=https%3a%2f%2fwww.livemeeting.com%2fcc%2fusergroups%2fjoin%3fid%3dRJHH7C%
	26role%3dattend>  \n\nAudio Information \nTelephone conferencing\nUse the 
	information below to connect: \nToll-free: +1 (866) 379-8990 \nParticipant
	 code: 6489756 \nFirst Time Users: \nTo save time before the meeting\, che
	ck your system  <https://owa.sqlpass.org/owa/redir.aspx?URL=http%3a%2f%2fg
	o.microsoft.com%2ffwlink%2f%3fLinkId%3d90703> to make sure it is ready to 
	use Microsoft Office Live Meeting. \nTroubleshooting\nUnable to join the m
	eeting? Follow these steps: \n1.	Copy this address and paste it into your 
	web browser: \nhttps://www.livemeeting.com/cc/usergroups/join <https://owa
	.sqlpass.org/owa/redir.aspx?URL=https%3a%2f%2fwww.livemeeting.com%2fcc%2fu
	sergroups%2fjoin>  \n2.	Copy and paste the required information: \nMeeting
	 ID: RJHH7C\nLocation: https://www.livemeeting.com/cc/usergroups <https://
	owa.sqlpass.org/owa/redir.aspx?URL=https%3a%2f%2fwww.livemeeting.com%2fcc%
	2fusergroups>  \nIf you still cannot enter the meeting\, contact support <
	https://owa.sqlpass.org/owa/redir.aspx?URL=http%3a%2f%2fr.office.microsoft
	.com%2fr%2frlidLiveMeeting%3fp1%3d12%26p2%3den_US%26p3%3dLMInfo%26p4%3dsup
	port> \n\nNotice \nMicrosoft Office Live Meeting can be used to record mee
	tings. By participating in this meeting\, you agree that your communicatio
	ns may be monitored or recorded at any time during the meeting. \n\n\n
